{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to STARVAULT \u2013 the first full-scale VR MOBA SHOOTER.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your hero. Squad up. Push lanes. Farm creeps. Clear jungle camps. Upgrade your abilities mid-match. And dominate the map in intense 5v5 team fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020320/extras/0f452b6dee778bc60056117d058717d9.poster.avif?t=1757877012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020320/extras/0f452b6dee778bc60056117d058717d9.webm?t=1757877012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020320/extras/0f452b6dee778bc60056117d058717d9.mp4?t=1757877012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from 11 unique heroes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with their own weapons, skills, and playstyles. Team synergy is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020320/extras/27f2be87412888b0c56c422e6e633bfc.poster.avif?t=1757877012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020320/extras/27f2be87412888b0c56c422e6e633bfc.webm?t=1757877012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020320/extras/27f2be87412888b0c56c422e6e633bfc.mp4?t=1757877012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push enemy lanes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy towers, and capture vision obelisks to gain strategic map control. Use portals and jump pads for mobility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020320/extras/7e75bdf92a4fcaed7fe8f90c3443fde1.poster.avif?t=1757877012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020320/extras/7e75bdf92a4fcaed7fe8f90c3443fde1.webm?t=1757877012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020320/extras/7e75bdf92a4fcaed7fe8f90c3443fde1.mp4?t=1757877012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Jungle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm creeps, clear camps, and gain XP &amp; credits to unlock your abilities and buy artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020320/extras/42015a2a6c7b6a9d2842a61a066f7257.poster.avif?t=1757877012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020320/extras/42015a2a6c7b6a9d2842a61a066f7257.webm?t=1757877012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020320/extras/42015a2a6c7b6a9d2842a61a066f7257.mp4?t=1757877012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rule the Fight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush your enemies in 5v5 team fights, shatter their Energy Core, and claim victory as the true master of STARVAULT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020320/extras/3a83b63afe8d9337f1007d903f31736a.poster.avif?t=1757877012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source